          "durationMs": 30228,
          "turns": [
            {
              "prompt": "This workspace is a small reeval project (npm package `reeval` is installed; use `npx reeval`). Its `reeval.config.ts` uses reeval’s fake harness so `npx reeval run` and `--dry-run` work inside the project without API keys. `npx reeval run --dry-run` fails. Fix reeval.config.ts and the evals so the plan is what the author meant: the docs eval compares no docs (the control) against the with-docs environment, 3 runs per cell, and `npx reeval run` passes. Leave docs/ alone. Then list each mistake you fixed, one line each.",
              "status": "completed",
              "startedAt": "2026-10-19T14:46:04.122Z",
              "durationMs": 18898,
              "usage": {
                "input": 116867,
                "output": 1693,
                "cacheRead": 98080,
                "cacheWrite": 0,
